<% content_for :title, "Social Pressure Relapse Plan | Bipolar Sober" %>

<main class="relapse-plan-page">

  <section class="relapse-plan-hero">
    <div class="relapse-plan-container">
      <%= link_to "← ALL RELAPSE PLANS", toolbox_relapse_plans_path,
          class: "relapse-plan-back" %>

      <p class="relapse-plan-eyebrow">
        BIPOLAR SOBER / RELAPSE PLANS / SOCIAL PRESSURE
      </p>

      <h1>
        <span>EVERYONE’S</span>
        <span>DRINKING.</span>
        <span>AND?</span>
      </h1>

      <p class="relapse-plan-intro">
        MY SOBRIETY PLAN FOR PARTIES, CELEBRATIONS &amp; "JUST ONE."
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="relapse-plan-section relapse-plan-pink">
    <div class="relapse-plan-container">
      <p class="relapse-plan-label">01 / MY EXPERIENCE</p>
      <h2>WHERE THE<br>PRESSURE LIVES.</h2>

      <div class="relapse-plan-copy">
        <p>[Write about social drinking, celebrations, and the situations you find difficult.]</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="relapse-plan-section relapse-plan-black">
    <div class="relapse-plan-container">
      <p class="relapse-plan-label">02 / BEFORE I GO</p>
      <h2>PLAN THE<br>WHOLE NIGHT.</h2>

      <div class="relapse-plan-grid">
        <div class="relapse-plan-box">
          <h3>THE SITUATION</h3>
          <p>[Write what you want to consider before attending.]</p>
        </div>

        <div class="relapse-plan-box">
          <h3>MY SUPPORT PERSON</h3>
          <p>[Write who knows your plan and how to contact them.]</p>
        </div>

        <div class="relapse-plan-box">
          <h3>MY PRACTICAL SETUP</h3>
          <p>[Write your arrangements for drinks, timing, and other details.]</p>
        </div>

        <div class="relapse-plan-box">
          <h3>MY WAY HOME</h3>
          <p>[Write your transportation and backup arrangements.]</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="relapse-plan-section relapse-plan-yellow">
    <div class="relapse-plan-container">
      <p class="relapse-plan-label">03 / IN THE MOMENT</p>
      <h2>HAVE THE<br>WORDS READY.</h2>

      <div class="relapse-plan-grid">
        <div class="relapse-plan-box">
          <h3>WHEN SOMEONE OFFERS</h3>
          <p>[Write the response you want to use.]</p>
        </div>

        <div class="relapse-plan-box">
          <h3>WHEN SOMEONE PUSHES</h3>
          <p>[Write your boundary in your own words.]</p>
        </div>

        <div class="relapse-plan-box">
          <h3>WHEN I START BARGAINING</h3>
          <p>[Write your personal warning signs and next action.]</p>
        </div>

        <div class="relapse-plan-box">
          <h3>WHEN I WANT TO LEAVE</h3>
          <p>[Write your exit plan and the words you can use.]</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="relapse-plan-section relapse-plan-purple">
    <div class="relapse-plan-container">
      <p class="relapse-plan-label">04 / AFTERWARD</p>
      <h2>THE NIGHT<br>DOESN’T END THERE.</h2>

      <div class="relapse-plan-copy">
        <p>[Write your after-event check-in and plan for any lingering drinking urges.]</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</main>